{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Theming Guide","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}]},"sections":[],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/themingguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Customize the visual appearance of your TUIkit application with palettes."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit includes a full theming system with six built-in palettes inspired by classic CRT terminals. Palettes define semantic colors for backgrounds, foregrounds, accents, and UI elements.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Built-in-Palettes","type":"heading","text":"Built-in Palettes"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Palette","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Preset","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inspiration"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Green","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".green","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"IBM 5151, Apple II","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Amber"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".amber"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IBM 3278, Wyse 50"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Red"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".red"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Military terminals","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type